/T (tooltip zref@2)
/TU (Diagram of the proposed ASM framework, illustrating the integration of digitalisation capabilities, technological drivers, enablers, and preventive measures to support hyper-connected smart production. Key capabilities include strategic management, resource readiness, real-time capability, and integration, each facilitating digital transformation. Positive impacts, categorised as economic, environmental, and social values, such as productivity gains, renewable energy use, and enhanced customer satisfaction, are outlined. Core emerging technologies, including AI and IoT, drive the framework. Preventive measures, such as stakeholder collaboration and sustainability orientation, aim to mitigate risks, while potential negative impacts, including system complexity, environmental degradation, and social inequality, are addressed.)
/Type /Annot
